{"code":"PK11","wikidata":"Q123537372","wikipedia":{"en":"Chaeng Watthana 14 MRT station","th":"สถานีแจ้งวัฒนะ 14"},"summary":{"en":"Chaeng Watthana 14 station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Chaeng Watthana Road, near Soi Chaeng Watthana 14 in Lak Si district, Bangkok. The station has four exits.","th":"สถานีแจ้งวัฒนะ 14 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนแจ้งวัฒนะในพื้นที่เขตหลักสี่ กรุงเทพมหานคร และเป็นสถานีแรกของสายสีชมพูที่อยู่ในเขตการปกครองของกรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Chaeng_Watthana_14_Station_20231125-4.jpg?utm_sou